title: "Consciousness Circle Metadata Specification"
version: "0.1.2"
date-released: "2026-05-26"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Shidenkai"
    family-names: "Alpha"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SamuraiWriter7/consciousness-circle-metadata-specification-v0.1"
abstract: >-
  Consciousness Circle Metadata Specification v0.1.1 defines a metadata layer
  for annotating the question, friction, surface facts, deep context, relational
  dynamics, trace governance, and allocation-readiness of content items in
  AI-mediated knowledge ecosystems. This version extends the initial
  specification with documentation describing its relationship to Trace
  Protocol, Royalty OS, and RAG integration workflows, while preserving privacy,
  consent, human review, and the separation between semantic metadata and
  automatic allocation.
keywords:
